      "type": "Session",
      "label": "Store, kg add, and the move to English",
      "description": "Goal: Implement #4 (store) and #5 (kg add); try a graph on basic-python-cli.\nInstructions: Commit before opening the PR; the user reviews design decisions first.\nDiscoveries: Validation warnings for custom types read as if the user had done something wrong, and name no concrete standard type. The project in Spanish would be less visible.\nAccomplished: `kg init` and a single deterministic `.kg/graph.json` (PR #17); `kg add` merge by ID (PR #19); a valid graph of basic-python-cli stored in its `.kg/`; issue #18 opened; the docs, CLI and code translated to English (#20, PRs #21 to #23).\nNext steps: Merge #21 then #22 so the English README shows on main; then #6, the Python extractor.\nRelevant files: src/kg/store.py, src/kg/merge.py, docs/store.md, README.md",
