      "id": "decision:single-graph-json",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "One graph.json per store",
      "description": "What: The store is a single `.kg/graph.json`, not two files: atomic writes, one object per node or edge, a fixed order so a change touches only its own lines.\nWhy: Inside a project, one graph is what a user expects to find in `.kg/`.\nWhere: docs/store.md",
